PATENT NOTICE:
The architecture implemented in this repository is protected by
international patent application PCT/IB2026/053070 (153 WIPO member
countries) with Turkish national priority TR 2025/012696 (September 4,
2025). WIPO DAS access code: 3D2B.

The patent covers the architectural principle of using temporal rate of
change (ΔC/Δt) as the primary signal for autonomous hardware gating
decisions within an integrated hardware decision chain. This protection
extends to reimplementations in any hardware description language,
circuit topology, or process node.

The TÜRKPATENT official international search report has confirmed the
novelty and inventive step of this architecture over:
  - HP Memristor Patent US8450711B2 (May 2013)
  - IBM Neuromorphic Architecture Patent US11144718B2 (October 2021)

